# Introduction

The #1 Experience Management Platform

In today''s digital age, customers are more fickle than ever and can easily switch to a competing brand if they''re not satisfied.

The demands of customers and employees have never been higher, and meeting those demands in real time is more important than ever.

Qwary is the answer. Our experience management platform centralizes all feedback - whether it''s collected through offline or online channels - and provides powerful insights into customer and employee satisfaction. With our text AI machine learning algorithm, we''re able to generate trend and sentimental reports that reduce the resources needed to manage customer and employee feedback data.

Last updated 2 years ago', ARRAY[]::text[], '- Introduction', NULL, false, 187, '1.3.0', 'a6f7d6d2-2f07-4fa2-8f13-dc5083bb8188', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
