# Native Case Management System

You can create follow-up tickets for your customer service, sales, marketing, and product teams to collaborate on resolving your customer issues.

Qwary''s ultimate pricing plan comes with the native case management system. You don''t need an extra Zendesk, or Freshdesk subscription if you are subscribed to our ultimate plan.', ARRAY[]::text[], '- Native Case Management System', NULL, false, 97, '1.3.0', 'b7a57654-7518-430b-986b-8e1d0e672555', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
