Step 9 screenshot

### 10. Click on Filter By Question

Filter By Question: You can even use triggers to respond to a question within the survey.

Filter By Variable: You can trigger the survey variable. The survey variable is the information you passed to us about the customer, like traffic referral, product purchase, business location, and more.

Filter By Response Metadata: Trigger on contact profile like a subscription plan. Filter By Collector: Trigger on email survey vs. SMS survey vs. web survey Filter By Entities: Trigger on what customers mention in open-text questions or video responses.', ARRAY['Workflow', '1. Go to Qwary - Workflows', '7. Click on Create']::text[], '### 7. Click on Create

