# Website Feedback Button

Qwary''s Website Feedback Button empowers businesses to maximize customer satisfaction by simplifying feedback collection, enabling targeted campaigns, and promoting user engagement directly on your website or app.

Qwary helps you maximize customer satisfaction with the Website Feedback Button:

- Effortless feedback collection: Qwary''s intuitive platform allows you to launch website surveys quickly and easily, eliminating the need for extensive engineering support. With just a single deployment of our JavaScript on your website, you can seamlessly scale feedback collection across every page. This streamlined process enables you to target specific users, identify issues, and gain valuable insights into your site''s content and user experience, ultimately enhancing customer satisfaction.

- Targeted campaigns for personalized experiences: Qwary empowers you to set up campaigns targeting website visitors based on their browsing or user behaviors. By tailoring the feedback collection process to individual user segments, you can gather insights directly relevant to their needs and preferences. This personalization enhances the overall customer experience, increasing satisfaction and loyalty.', ARRAY[]::text[], '- Website Feedback Button', NULL, false, 314, '1.3.0', '7b571bee-974f-490e-80de-3b5663ccf2d6', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
INSERT INTO askcontent."document_chunk" ("connector_id", "document_id", "chunk_id", "ordinal", "text", "heading_path", "parent_text", "page", "is_table", "token_estimate", "chunker_version", "id", "org_id", "created_at", "updated_at", "is_code", "overlap") VALUES ('614b6e5a-b1ce-4901-bda6-de617e10da04', '6f36192e-d8eb-48dc-b17a-5a901044be91', 'chk_9237651368ca6db3', 1, '- Enhanced user engagement and data enrichment: With Qwary''s "Always on" feedback button, you allow users to provide feedback on specific parts of your website. This feature encourages active engagement, allowing users to voice their opinions, suggestions, or concerns in real time. Additionally, Qwary captures relevant metadata on website users, including browser information, device details, and location. This enriched data provides a deeper context when analyzing feedback, enabling you to understand user experiences better and take targeted actions to improve satisfaction.

- Brand-aligned customization: Qwary offers extensive customization options, allowing you to design the feedback buttons and surveys to align with your brand''s visual identity. This cohesive branding creates a consistent and familiar experience for your customers, reinforcing their trust in your brand and enhancing their overall satisfaction.', ARRAY['Website Feedback Button']::text[], '# Website Feedback Button

Qwary''s Website Feedback Button empowers businesses to maximize customer satisfaction by simplifying feedback collection, enabling targeted campaigns, and promoting user engagement directly on your website or app.

Qwary helps you maximize customer satisfaction with the Website Feedback Button:

- Effortless feedback collection: Qwary''s intuitive platform allows you to launch website surveys quickly and easily, eliminating the need for extensive engineering support. With just a single deployment of our JavaScript on your website, you can seamlessly scale feedback collection across every page. This streamlined process enables you to target specific users, identify issues, and gain valuable insights into your site''s content and user experience, ultimately enhancing customer satisfaction.

- Targeted campaigns for personalized experiences: Qwary empowers you to set up campaigns targeting website visitors based on their browsing or user behaviors. By tailoring the feedback collection process to individual user segments, you can gather insights directly relevant to their needs and preferences. This personalization enhances the overall customer experience, increasing satisfaction and loyalty.

- Enhanced user engagement and data enrichment: With Qwary''s "Always on" feedback button, you allow users to provide feedback on specific parts of your website. This feature encourages active engagement, allowing users to voice their opinions, suggestions, or concerns in real time. Additionally, Qwary captures relevant metadata on website users, including browser information, device details, and location. This enriched data provides a deeper context when analyzing feedback, enabling you to understand user experiences better and take targeted actions to improve satisfaction.

- Brand-aligned customization: Qwary offers extensive customization options, allowing you to design the feedback buttons and surveys to align with your brand''s visual identity. This cohesive branding creates a consistent and familiar experience for your customers, reinforcing their trust in your brand and enhancing their overall satisfaction.

- Continuous improvement through data-driven insights: Qwary''s comprehensive analytics and reporting features enable you to extract actionable insights from the feedback collected. By analyzing the data, identifying trends, and uncovering pain points, you can make data-driven decisions to improve your website continuously, address customer concerns, and optimize the customer journey. This iterative approach demonstrates your commitment to customer satisfaction and fosters long-term loyalty.

How to create a website feedback button

