- What are System Dynamic Variables?

- Here is the list of System Dynamic Variables:

- How to add custom Dynamic Variables for your survey?

- Go to your chosen survey and Select Logic from Left Menu Options.

- Create New Variable and Click Create

- Continue adding your dynamic variables

- How to personalize your survey with Dynamic Variables?

- Click the button P on the welcome page, thank you page, question title, or answer text and it will open up a new dropdown.

- Select Survey Variables > Choose Variable Or Contact Details > Choose Contact Field to Personalize by Audience Names.

- How to pass Dynamic Variables to your survey?

- Copy Survey URL

