# Web

Qwary''s intercept SDK implementation enables you to observe and track your customers'' interactions, enabling you to create user journeys and prompts that trigger surveys, prototype tests, and replays. This empowers you to ask tailored questions and capture critical moments at the opportune moments. Integrating Qwary into your website or web app lets you transmit user Events and Attributes linked to their activities on your platform.

Installation Options

- JavaScript SDK

- Google Tag Manager

Last updated 2 years ago', ARRAY[]::text[], '- Google Tag Manager', NULL, false, 138, '1.3.0', 'c78a0869-244f-46ca-9a09-5449ff281477', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
