Zapier is a web-based automation tool that allows users to connect apps and automate tasks without coding. It enables users to create custom workflows called "Zaps" that trigger actions in one app based on events in another, thus helping streamline business processes and save time.', ARRAY['Zapier']::text[], '# Zapier

Zapier is a web-based automation tool that allows users to connect apps and automate tasks without coding. It enables users to create custom workflows called "Zaps" that trigger actions in one app based on events in another, thus helping streamline business processes and save time.', NULL, false, 73, '1.3.0', '4b6307b3-1a18-44e8-b9be-862a0679fd27', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
INSERT INTO askcontent."document_chunk" ("connector_id", "document_id", "chunk_id", "ordinal", "text", "heading_path", "parent_text", "page", "is_table", "token_estimate", "chunker_version", "id", "org_id", "created_at", "updated_at", "is_code", "overlap") VALUES ('614b6e5a-b1ce-4901-bda6-de617e10da04', '44d31267-a614-44a7-9666-772e49f85d4c', 'chk_1875de013a7cafe0', 1, '### Here are a few examples of how you can use Qwary and Zapier together to improve customer experience:

- Automatically send customer feedback to a CRM: With this integration, you can set up a Zap that automatically sends feedback from Qwary to your CRM, so your team can keep track of customer sentiment and respond accordingly.

- Create customer support tickets: You can set up a Zap that automatically creates a customer support ticket in your helpdesk software whenever a customer submits feedback through Qwary.

- Send notifications to a customer support team: If you want to be notified whenever a customer submits feedback through Qwary, you can set up a Zap that sends a notification to a customer support team''s slack channel.

- Send survey results to a data visualization tool: you can use Qwary to conduct surveys and use zapier to send the results to a data visualization tool like Tableau or PowerBI.', ARRAY['Zapier', 'Here are a few examples of how you can use Qwary and Zapier together to improve customer experience:']::text[], '### Here are a few examples of how you can use Qwary and Zapier together to improve customer experience:

- Automatically send customer feedback to a CRM: With this integration, you can set up a Zap that automatically sends feedback from Qwary to your CRM, so your team can keep track of customer sentiment and respond accordingly.

- Create customer support tickets: You can set up a Zap that automatically creates a customer support ticket in your helpdesk software whenever a customer submits feedback through Qwary.

- Send notifications to a customer support team: If you want to be notified whenever a customer submits feedback through Qwary, you can set up a Zap that sends a notification to a customer support team''s slack channel.

- Send survey results to a data visualization tool: you can use Qwary to conduct surveys and use zapier to send the results to a data visualization tool like Tableau or PowerBI.

- Add feedback to a project management tool: You can use Qwary to collect customer feedback, and Zapier automatically adds it to a project management tool like Asana, Trello, or Jira so your team can track customer feedback and work on improvements.

Remember that these are just a few examples of using Qwary and Zapier together. You can use them in many ways per your business requirement.', NULL, false, 229, '1.3.0', '1d7b9df4-5392-40ee-857d-3ce9f693bdc5', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
