# Product Onboarding Surveys

Onboarding is a great place to collect insights on customer expectations and use the information to personalize onboarding & messaging.

## Synch survey data with CRM Tools.

The targeted audience will now start participating in the Onboarding process. You can create an integration to synch survey data with CRM Tools like Intercom and Mailchimp. Please find the help center article to create integration flows.

Last updated 3 years ago

- Create Product Onboarding Survey in Qwary.

- Go to distribute & copy the survey link.

- Create IFrame Script.

- Login to usetiful & create an onboarding tour.

- Add steps & modal.

- Select the source code option.

- Paste updated IFrame script into source code.

- Complete your onboarding steps & publish the tour.

- Synch survey data with CRM Tools.', ARRAY[]::text[], '- Use Cases Product Onboarding Surveys', NULL, false, 217, '1.3.0', 'ba04eaca-fb22-41f4-931f-f18185c3e22c', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
INSERT INTO askcontent."document_chunk" ("connector_id", "document_id", "chunk_id", "ordinal", "text", "heading_path", "parent_text", "page", "is_table", "token_estimate", "chunker_version", "id", "org_id", "created_at", "updated_at", "is_code", "overlap") VALUES ('614b6e5a-b1ce-4901-bda6-de617e10da04', '927c1b95-0acb-4de0-841d-9f9faadaeea8', 'chk_88b74e527d59aab8', 0, '- Product Survey Questions Guide

# Product Survey Questions Guide

If you''re thinking about creating a survey for your product, here are some important questions to ask. By collecting feedback from customers, you can get valuable insights into what people think about your product. This can help you make improvements and drive sales.

Some things to consider when creating your survey include the product''s features, how easy it is to use, and how it compares to similar products on the market. You''ll also want to ask customers about the pros and cons of the product, and whether or not they would recommend it to a friend. Finally, be sure to ask customers for their overall opinion of the product and how likely they are to purchase it.

By asking these key questions, you can get a better understanding of what people think about your product. This feedback can then be used to make improvements and drive sales.', ARRAY[]::text[], '- Product Survey Questions Guide', NULL, false, 229, '1.3.0', 'a0cd3d21-6e5a-443d-90f7-e74f9c62a659', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
INSERT INTO askcontent."document_chunk" ("connector_id", "document_id", "chunk_id", "ordinal", "text", "heading_path", "parent_text", "page", "is_table", "token_estimate", "chunker_version", "id", "org_id", "created_at", "updated_at", "is_code", "overlap") VALUES ('614b6e5a-b1ce-4901-bda6-de617e10da04', '927c1b95-0acb-4de0-841d-9f9faadaeea8', 'chk_18ae6b1e93b4a115', 1, '### Here Are The Questions You Need To Ask

When creating a product survey, there are a few key questions you need to ask in order to get valuable feedback from your respondents. Here are some of the most important questions to include:

- What was your overall experience with the product?

- Did the product meet your needs/expectations?

- How easy was the product to use?

- What did you like about the product?

- What didn''t you like about the product?

- Would you recommend the product to others?

- What would you change about the product?

Asking these questions will help you get a better understanding of how customers feel about your product, what areas need improvement, and what customers would like to see changed.

Including a mix of both qualitative and quantitative questions will give you the most comprehensive feedback possible so that you can make changes and improve your product.', ARRAY['Product Survey Questions Guide', 'Here Are The Questions You Need To Ask']::text[], '### Here Are The Questions You Need To Ask

When creating a product survey, there are a few key questions you need to ask in order to get valuable feedback from your respondents. Here are some of the most important questions to include:

- What was your overall experience with the product?

- Did the product meet your needs/expectations?

- How easy was the product to use?

- What did you like about the product?

- What didn''t you like about the product?

- Would you recommend the product to others?

- What would you change about the product?

Asking these questions will help you get a better understanding of how customers feel about your product, what areas need improvement, and what customers would like to see changed.

Including a mix of both qualitative and quantitative questions will give you the most comprehensive feedback possible so that you can make changes and improve your product.', NULL, false, 226, '1.3.0', '8839b2e3-7cd9-4198-951e-1a83feb43bba', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
INSERT INTO askcontent."document_chunk" ("connector_id", "document_id", "chunk_id", "ordinal", "text", "heading_path", "parent_text", "page", "is_table", "token_estimate", "chunker_version", "id", "org_id", "created_at", "updated_at", "is_code", "overlap") VALUES ('614b6e5a-b1ce-4901-bda6-de617e10da04', '927c1b95-0acb-4de0-841d-9f9faadaeea8', 'chk_3a0ee3d6a9b48462', 2, '### What are the product’s features?

When creating a product survey, it is important to include questions that will elicit information about the features of the product. By understanding the features of the product, you will be able to better understand its strengths and weaknesses.

Here are some examples of questions that you can use to learn about the features of a product:

- What are the product’s dimensions?

- What is the weight of the product?

- What is the product made out of?

- What are the product’s key features?

- How does the product work?

- What are the benefits of using the product?

- What are the drawbacks of using the product?

- Is the product easy to use?

- Is the product durable?

- Is the product value for money?

- Would you recommend this product to others?', ARRAY['Product Survey Questions Guide', 'Here Are The Questions You Need To Ask', 'What are the product’s features?']::text[], '### What are the product’s features?

