If you have a lot of customers who respond negatively to this question, it could be an indication that there are serious problems with the product. In this case, it would be important to take action to address the issues that were raised.

On the other hand, if only a small number of customers mention problems with the product, it could be that the issues are not widespread. In this case, you might decide to take no action or only make minor changes to the product.

Ultimately, whether or not you take action based on the results of this question will depend on a number of factors. But asking the question is a good way to get valuable feedback from your customers.', NULL, false, 231, '1.3.0', 'ea850072-22ee-4507-84d3-4b93d8436df9', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
