Several factors contribute to a high CES score. These include creating an easy-to-use product or service and providing prompt support. It''s also essential to ensure that the content on your website is accurate and up-to-date, as this will help customers get the most out of using your product or service. Finally, you must maintain good relationships with your customers by regularly communicating with them and providing value beyond just the products or services you offer.', NULL, false, 340, '1.3.0', '36981f9b-6c4e-4e6d-b059-6ed1fb20d7e5', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
