Customer satisfaction is a crucial goal for any business, and CES can be essential in achieving this. CES can help you identify gaps in your customer service. This can improve customer satisfaction as you can address these issues quickly and efficiently. Additionally, using CES can help you understand what customers want. By understanding your customer’s needs, you can create products and services that are more valuable to them. Finally, using CES will lead to further improvements in customer satisfaction over time.', ARRAY['Ultimate Guide For Customer Effort Score (CES)', 'What Is A Customer Effort Score (CES)?', 'How Can CES Be Used To Improve Customer Satisfaction?']::text[], '### How Can CES Be Used To Improve Customer Satisfaction?

Customer satisfaction is a crucial goal for any business, and CES can be essential in achieving this. CES can help you identify gaps in your customer service. This can improve customer satisfaction as you can address these issues quickly and efficiently. Additionally, using CES can help you understand what customers want. By understanding your customer’s needs, you can create products and services that are more valuable to them. Finally, using CES will lead to further improvements in customer satisfaction over time.', NULL, false, 145, '1.3.0', 'f7249f8c-2fb1-4abc-aa26-af9c2bb5d9c6', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
