An overdraft fee of $35 is assessed per item when an item is paid into overdraft. No more than three overdraft fees are assessed per business day. No overdraft fee is assessed when the account is overdrawn by $5 or less at the end of the business day.', ARRAY['Purpose', 'Overdraft and returned item fees']::text[], '## Overdraft and returned item fees

An overdraft fee of $35 is assessed per item when an item is paid into overdraft. No more than three overdraft fees are assessed per business day. No overdraft fee is assessed when the account is overdrawn by $5 or less at the end of the business day.

| Fee | Amount | Daily cap |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Overdraft (item paid) | $35 | 3 per day |
| Returned item (item declined) | $0 | — |
| Overdraft protection transfer | $12.50 | 1 per day |', NULL, false, 72, '1.1.0', '7a0dacf7-f3ab-4c6f-8259-26254dd1db44', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-22 23:31:43.654475+00:00', '2026-08-22 23:31:43.654475+00:00', false, '');
