If the Fedwire interface itself is unhealthy, page Payments Engineering on-call and notify the Treasury Services duty manager. A missed cut-off is reportable to Operational Risk within one business day.', ARRAY['1. Detect', '4. Escalate']::text[], '## 4. Escalate

