The institution must accept the instrument, or deliver a written refusal stating the reason, within 10 business days of presentation.

A third party who refuses to honour a statutory form power of attorney must state the reason for refusal in writing.', ARRAY['6. Third-party acceptance and refusal']::text[], '# 6. Third-party acceptance and refusal

The institution must accept the instrument, or deliver a written refusal stating the reason, within 10 business days of presentation.

