Authority terminates on the death of the principal, on revocation delivered to the agent, on the termination date stated in the instrument, or by court order. The institution is protected where it acts in good faith without actual knowledge of the termination.', ARRAY['7. Revocation and termination']::text[], '# 7. Revocation and termination

