The difference between a good and bad CES score can be significant. A good CES score indicates that your company is up to date with the latest technologies and trends, while a bad CES score can mean that your company is behind the times. Factors that influence an excellent CES score include the quality of your products and services, the strength of your partnerships, and the level of innovation in your industry. How to improve your CES score depends on what needs to be improved; however, some general tips include being proactive regarding technology adoption, investing in research and development, and enhancing customer service.', ARRAY['Ultimate Guide For Customer Effort Score (CES)', 'What Is A Customer Effort Score (CES)?', 'The Difference Between A Good And Bad CES Score']::text[], '### The Difference Between A Good And Bad CES Score

The difference between a good and bad CES score can be significant. A good CES score indicates that your company is up to date with the latest technologies and trends, while a bad CES score can mean that your company is behind the times. Factors that influence an excellent CES score include the quality of your products and services, the strength of your partnerships, and the level of innovation in your industry. How to improve your CES score depends on what needs to be improved; however, some general tips include being proactive regarding technology adoption, investing in research and development, and enhancing customer service.', NULL, false, 172, '1.3.0', 'bac96300-8045-4993-bc96-514dcc9111ae', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
