INSERT INTO askcontent."document_chunk" ("connector_id", "document_id", "chunk_id", "ordinal", "text", "heading_path", "parent_text", "page", "is_table", "token_estimate", "chunker_version", "id", "org_id", "created_at", "updated_at", "is_code", "overlap") VALUES ('614b6e5a-b1ce-4901-bda6-de617e10da04', 'b6f0616b-6a54-4fe2-986a-0f7f84515366', 'chk_1594484c6ddf1aba', 7, '### Sample NPS Survey Questions

It can be hard to know what to say when conducting an NPS survey, as there are so many different things that could qualify as a "positive" or "negative" experience. This is why it is important to have sample questions that cover a variety of different scenarios.

Here are some sample questions for a company''s NPS survey:

- How likely are you to recommend [company X] to a friend or colleague?

- What is the primary reason for your score?

- Which of the following words would you use to describe [company X]?

Select all that apply.

- Excellent, Good, Satisfactory, Needs Improvement, Unsatisfactory.

- I always feel welcome at [company X], even after attending only one meeting.

- The people who work at [company X] care about their customers and want them to be satisfied with their service.

It is important to be able to answer questions that cover a variety of scenarios in order to get an accurate reading on how people are feeling about [company X]. This is why having questions that focus on customer satisfaction and employee care are so important.', ARRAY['Ultimate Guide To Net Promoter Score (NPS)', 'What Is NPS?', 'Sample NPS Survey Questions']::text[], '### Sample NPS Survey Questions

