INSERT INTO askcontent."document_chunk" ("connector_id", "document_id", "chunk_id", "ordinal", "text", "heading_path", "parent_text", "page", "is_table", "token_estimate", "chunker_version", "id", "org_id", "created_at", "updated_at", "is_code", "overlap") VALUES ('614b6e5a-b1ce-4901-bda6-de617e10da04', 'b6f0616b-6a54-4fe2-986a-0f7f84515366', 'chk_f364abc1b3929f44', 13, '### Customer Follow Up Based On Score

Customer follow-up is an important part of customer service. It''s essential to ensure that customers are happy with the product or service they received, and to make sure that any problems are identified and resolved as quickly as possible.

There are a number of ways to follow up with customers based on their score. One approach is to contact customers who have scored highly in order to thank them for their feedback. Another approach is to try and resolve any issues that were raised by low-scoring customers. Understanding the reasoning behind a customer''s score can help you tailor follow up accordingly.

Text AI can be used to analyze NPS (Net Promoter Score) data. By analyzing this data, businesses can learn a lot about their customers and how they interact with their products or services. This information can be used to improve customer satisfaction and better understand what drives customer loyalty.', ARRAY['Ultimate Guide To Net Promoter Score (NPS)', 'What Is NPS?', 'Customer Follow Up Based On Score']::text[], '### Customer Follow Up Based On Score

Customer follow-up is an important part of customer service. It''s essential to ensure that customers are happy with the product or service they received, and to make sure that any problems are identified and resolved as quickly as possible.

There are a number of ways to follow up with customers based on their score. One approach is to contact customers who have scored highly in order to thank them for their feedback. Another approach is to try and resolve any issues that were raised by low-scoring customers. Understanding the reasoning behind a customer''s score can help you tailor follow up accordingly.

Text AI can be used to analyze NPS (Net Promoter Score) data. By analyzing this data, businesses can learn a lot about their customers and how they interact with their products or services. This information can be used to improve customer satisfaction and better understand what drives customer loyalty.

By understanding the reasons why customers give feedback, businesses can improve the quality of their interactions with them, ultimately leading to increased satisfaction rates for all parties involved.', NULL, false, 238, '1.3.0', 'a7e5974c-9efb-4241-976b-bc208169f6a0', '9a76da8a-4934-4a60-838d-ca2bf689bd38', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', '2026-08-23 15:16:23.389988+00:00', false, '');
INSERT INTO askcontent."document_chunk" ("connector_id", "document_id", "chunk_id", "ordinal", "text", "heading_path", "parent_text", "page", "is_table", "token_estimate", "chunker_version", "id", "org_id", "created_at", "updated_at", "is_code", "overlap") VALUES ('614b6e5a-b1ce-4901-bda6-de617e10da04', 'b6f0616b-6a54-4fe2-986a-0f7f84515366', 'chk_91acbdf83aaab973', 14, 'By understanding the reasons why customers give feedback, businesses can improve the quality of their interactions with them, ultimately leading to increased satisfaction rates for all parties involved.

### To Conclude

NPS is a powerful metric that can gauge customer satisfaction and loyalty. By understanding NPS and how it works, businesses can use it to improve customer retention, grow their business, and understand their customers better. Calculating your own NPS is simple and only takes a few minutes. To get started, you need a list of customers and a way to contact them. Once you have these things, you''re ready to start calculating your company''s NPS!

