Connect Qwary to Salesforce with scheduler workflow.

- Go to Workflows --> Create new workflow --> Select Schedule-based workflow, enter workflow name, and click ''Create.''

- Click on ''Add Task.'' and add ''Extract contact and/or account data from Salesforce Account.''

- Select opportunity or case email campaign and click ''connect.''

- Click on ''Connect'' again from the Salesforce integration overview page.

- Enter the Salesforce account username, password, consumer key, and consumer secret (from step 2e)

- You have successfully connected Qwary to your Salesforce account and will land on the task configuration page.

Create an email campaign for Salesforce Case/Opportunity.

- Click ''Add Survey'' on the task configuration page to Extract contact and/or account data from the Salesforce account.

- Mapping account and contact fields with a Salesforce object are incredibly easy. Select the contact list name from the dropdown menu to import contacts into a contact list in Qwary.', ARRAY['Import contact data from Salesforce to Qwary']::text[], '# Import contact data from Salesforce to Qwary

Qwary''s Salesforce integration simplifies contact import, making it easy to bring your Salesforce contacts into the Qwary platform for seamless data management.

