- Click ''Add Survey'' on the task configuration page to Extract contact and/or account data from the Salesforce account.

- Mapping account and contact fields with a Salesforce object are incredibly easy. Select the contact list name from the dropdown menu to import contacts into a contact list in Qwary.

- Click on ''Save'' for the task to save the task.

Define Schedule

Define a schedule for the task to run. Qwary runs SOQL query periodically to check if a new case/opportunity matching the defined criteria is found.

- Schedule by minutes - runs the workflow every defined minute.

- Schedule by hours - runs the workflow every defined hour.

- Schedule daily - runs the workflow daily.

- Schedule weekly - runs the workflow weekly.

- Schedule monthly - runs workflow monthly.

- Schedule yearly - runs workflow yearly.

Active the workflow

Click on the workflow menu to activate the workflow.

Qwary will run the workflow on a defined schedule, import new contacts and update an existing contact.

